                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "47 years ago, the 1977 Food Stamp Act established the SNAP program that we know today, expanding access to nutrition assistance for countless families. No child in America should go hungry, and I won't stop working to pass a bipartisan Farm Bill that protects this lifeline. https://t.co/lWF334HW2u",
