                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "No one should have to travel hours just to visit the doctor, and telemedicine is a great way to reduce the barriers to care so often faced by rural communities. I\u2019m proud to introduce the bipartisan Rural Wellness Act to expand access to this technology, especially for mental and behavioral health care.",
